---
description: Prisma usage rules
globs: packages/db/**/*.{ts,prisma}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Prisma

- Never expose Prisma client to the UI.
- All database access goes through repositories/services.
- Use `$transaction` for multi-step inventory and posting operations.
- Avoid N+1 queries; use selective `include` / `select`.
- Add indexes for searchable and FK fields.
- Schema lives in `packages/db/prisma`.
- Never put editable stock quantity on article/variant models.
